{"path":"regex/match_results/operator_cmp","title":"operator==,!=(std::match_results)","titleHtml":"operator==,!=<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(std::match_results)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/regex/match_results/operator_cmp","section":"regex","kind":"page","summary":"Compares two match_results objects.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/regex\">&lt;regex&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> BidirIt, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Alloc <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">==</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> match_results<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>BidirIt,Alloc<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> lhs,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;match_results<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>BidirIt,Alloc<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11 t-until-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> BidirIt, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Alloc <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> match_results<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>BidirIt,Alloc<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> lhs,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;match_results<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>BidirIt,Alloc<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx20\">(until C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Compares two <code>match_results</code> objects.\n</p><p>Two <code>match_results</code> are equal if the following conditions are met:\n</p>\n<ul><li> neither of the objects is <i>ready</i>, <i>or</i>\n</li><li> both match results are <i>ready</i> and the following conditions are met: \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs.<span class=\"me1\">empty</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs.<span class=\"me1\">empty</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, <i>or</i>\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy3\">!</span>lhs.<span class=\"me1\">empty</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy3\">!</span>rhs.<span class=\"me1\">empty</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> and the following conditions are met:\n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs.<span class=\"me1\">prefix</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">prefix</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/equal\"><span class=\"kw1585\">std::<span class=\"me2\">equal</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>lhs.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, lhs.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, rhs.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs.<span class=\"me1\">suffix</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">suffix</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</dd></dl>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Checks if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> are equal.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Checks if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> are not equal.</div>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx20\"><td>\n<p>The <code>!=</code> operator is <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/default_comparisons#Other_defaulted_comparison_operators\">synthesized</a> from <code>operator==</code>.\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> lhs, rhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> match results to compare\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par-hitem\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"> Type requirements\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par-req\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"> -<div class=\"spacer\"></div><code>BidirIt</code> must meet the requirements of <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/BidirectionalIterator\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">LegacyBidirectionalIterator</em></a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par-req\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"> -<div class=\"spacer\"></div><code>Alloc</code> must meet the requirements of <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/Allocator\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">Allocator</em></a>.\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> are equal, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> are not equal, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined exceptions. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"regex","title":"Regular expressions library (since C++11)"},{"path":"regex/match_results","title":"std::match_results"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"operator==,!=(std::match_results)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++11, until C++20. Compares two match_results objects."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"lhs, rhs"},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if lhs and rhs are equal, false otherwise."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20"],"wordCount":179,"codeBlockCount":0}
